From: lalayang123456-ctrl <lalayang123456-ctrl@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 18:34:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add SO-ARM101 generalist VLA adapters and workers

Add molmoact2_so101, pi05_so101 and g05_so101 adapters for robot_type so101
with the 6-D joint_position contract, plus worker support for the three
SO100/101 checkpoints.

- Convert between LeRobot's current calibration frame (Client) and the
  earlier SO100 frame these checkpoints were trained in.
- MolmoAct2-SO100_101: so100_so101_molmoact2 norm tag, native bfloat16.
- pi0.5 SO100/101: LeRobot worker using the checkpoint's saved processors.
- G05 SO100/101: launch upstream chunk server and drain its cached chunk.
- Add runtime config example, guide and loopback tests; no weights loaded.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
